  "definition": "Election Not to Participate in the NHBCP",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-01-09",
  "historyNote": "#9404, eff 3-5-09, EXPIRED: 3-5-17 New. #12333, INTERIM, eff 7-22-17, EXPIRES: 1-18-18; ss by #12448, eff 1-9-18",
